classDiagram
    %% PawPal+ final class design (Phase 6)
    %% Owner has pets, each Pet has care tasks, and the Scheduler
    %% builds a daily plan from the owner's tasks and available time.
    %% Parameters written as "= None" are optional; None means "use the default".

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +int available_minutes
        +list~str~ preferences
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +get_all_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task: Task) None
        +remove_task(title: str) None
        +complete_task(task: Task, completed_on: date = None) Optional~Task~
    }

    class Task {
        +str title
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +str pet_name
        +str frequency
        +bool completed
        +str time
        +date due_date
        +priority_rank() int
        +mark_complete() None
        +edit(title: str, duration_minutes: int, priority: str, time: str, due_date: date, frequency: str) None
        +next_occurrence(completed_on: date = None) Optional~Task~
        +describe() str
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +list~Task~ skipped_tasks
        +sort_by_priority(tasks: list~Task~) list~Task~
        +sort_by_time(tasks: list~Task~) list~Task~
        +filter_tasks(pet_name: str = None, completed: bool = None) list~Task~
        +find_conflicts(tasks: list~Task~ = None) list~str~
        +generate_plan() list~Task~
        +explain_plan(plan: list~Task~) str
    }

    Owner "1" o-- "0..*" Pet : owns
    Pet "1" *-- "0..*" Task : needs
    Scheduler --> Owner : plans for
    Scheduler ..> Task : sorts, filters, checks

    note for Task "time is HH:MM, or empty for anytime<br>frequency is daily, weekly, or once<br>both are checked when a Task is created"
    note for Pet "complete_task() marks a task done and adds<br>its next_occurrence() for daily/weekly tasks"
    note for Scheduler "priority picks tasks that fit available_minutes<br>sort_by_time() only orders them<br>find_conflicts() checks identical date + start time"
